    "evenflo_rich_text_prfidL": {
      "type": "evenflo-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_gVeK6R": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Here for the Journey",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "decorative_heading": false
          }
        },
        "text_pp9GqL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The day your child comes into the world, all the stakes are raised. Little things matter more. And the not so little things, like the brands and products you allow into your tight-knit family bubble, begin to weave themselves into the memories you create. Evenflo has been trusted by families for more than 100 years for innovative products designed to make togetherness easier, safer and more comfortable. We’re here for you whether you’re looking for the best <a href=\"https://evenflobaby.myshopify.com/collections/car-seats\" title=\"Car Seats\">car seat</a>, <a href=\"https://evenflobaby.myshopify.com/collections/strollers\" title=\"Strollers\">stroller</a> or <a href=\"https://evenflobaby.myshopify.com/collections/travel-systems\" title=\"Travel Systems\">travel system</a>, <a href=\"https://evenflobaby.myshopify.com/pages/babyproofing\" title=\"EVENFLO IS HERE TO HELP!\">baby proofing</a> every room of your house, taking playdates on the road with a portable <a href=\"https://evenflobaby.myshopify.com/collections/playards-and-bassinets\" title=\"Playards\">playard</a>, protecting your little cruiser with a <a href=\"https://evenflobaby.myshopify.com/collections/baby-gates\" title=\"Baby Gates\">baby gate</a>, or finding a convertible <a href=\"https://evenflobaby.myshopify.com/collections/high-chairs\" title=\"High Chairs\">high chair </a>to grow with your sprout. Evenflo. Here for the journey.</p>"
          }
        },
